<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Sonae approves capital call.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Sonae approves capital call.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonae Investimentos' shareholders approved on Friday an authorisation for the group to boost capital to 50 billion escudos, from the current 14 billion, over the next five years.</p>
<p>The approval was granted at the distribution and real estate group's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>($1=172.2 escudos)</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
